          "version": null,
          "scope": "sample-editor-note",
          "passage": "# Draft editor status guide\n\nSynthetic, undated development note for the sample team editor:\n\n- `Saved` means the draft revision has been stored in the workspace.\n- `Published` means a published copy was created from a saved revision and is available on the team page.\n- Saving further edits does not replace the existing published copy.\n- The editor's preview opens the most recently published copy by default.\n",
          "contentHash": "8e76a68f37f204332c0618bc256134674ac6ffbe4b44280164363f61871ec281",
          "validity": "current"
        }
      ],
      "reflectionRequired": true,
      "proposedAnswer": "Savedは下書き保存。チームページには公開版が表示され、追加保存だけでは公開版は置き換わらない。Publishedは保存済み版から公開用コピーを作成した状態。プレビューは既定で最新の公開版を開く。合成・日付不明のメモによる説明であり実製品の現状は未確認。",
      "capabilities": [
        "read_local_document"
      ],
